<verse eid="LEV 6:27" /><verse style="v" number="28" sid="LEV 6:28" />and an earthen vessel in which it is boiled is broken, and if it is boiled in <char style="w" strong="H3068">a</char> bronze vessel, then it is scoured and rinsed with water. <verse eid="LEV 6:28" /><verse style="v" number="29" sid="LEV 6:29" />Every male among the priests eats it—it [is] most holy;
